# The layout sweep's raw screenshots: roughly 60 MB a run, and regenerated by
# `scripts/layout-sweep.sh` on demand. The contact sheets under `_sheets/` are
# what a reviewer actually looks at, so those are kept.
docs/screenshots/sweep/*
!docs/screenshots/sweep/_sheets/
